Gfx - two-dimensional graphics with high-level operations: paths of lines, arcs and Bezier curves,
stroked and filled, transformations, clipping, images, outline and raster fonts; the same drawing
goes to the screen (GfxDisplay), to images (GfxBuffer), to printers (GfxPrinter) and to PostScript
(GfxPS, the package gfx-ps)

  Desktops.OpenDoc GfxOverview.html    the overview (with an HTML viewer)
  Desktops.OpenDoc GfxHowto.html       how to use it
